{"metadata":{"title":"RenderContext","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RenderContext","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Workflow"}],"roleHeading":"Class","externalID":"s:8Workflow13RenderContextC","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RenderContext"}],"symbolKind":"class"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Workflow\/documentation\/Workflow"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Workflow\/documentation\/Workflow\/RenderContext","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"code":"RenderContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the composition point for the workflow tree.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Workflow\/documentation\/Workflow\/RenderContext\/makeOutputSink()","doc:\/\/Workflow\/documentation\/Workflow\/RenderContext\/makeSink(of:)","doc:\/\/Workflow\/documentation\/Workflow\/RenderContext\/makeSink(of:onEvent:)","doc:\/\/Workflow\/documentation\/Workflow\/RenderContext\/makeStateMutationSink()","doc:\/\/Workflow\/documentation\/Workflow\/RenderContext\/runSideEffect(key:action:)"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RenderContext"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"WorkflowType"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WorkflowType"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Workflow\/documentation\/Workflow\/Workflow","preciseIdentifier":"s:8WorkflowAAP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Workflow"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"During a render pass, a workflow may want to defer to a child"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"workflow to render some portion of its content. For example,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a workflow that renders to a split-screen view model might"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delegate to child A for the left side, and child B for the right"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"side view models. Nesting allows for a fractal tree that is constructed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out of many small parts."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a parent wants to delegate to a child workflow, it must first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"create an instance of that workflow. This can be thought of as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"model of the child workflow. It does not contain any active state,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it simply contains the data necessary to create or update a workflow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"node."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The parent then calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"render(workflow:outputMap:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with two values:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The child workflow."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A closure that transforms the child’s output events into the parent’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" type so that the parent can respond to events generated by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the child."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the parent had previously rendered a child of the same type, the existing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"child workflow node is updated."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the parent had not rendered a child of the same type in the previous"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"render pass, a new child workflow node is generated."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The infrastructure then performs a render pass on the child to obtain its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Rendering"},{"type":"text","text":" value, which is then returned to the caller."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/workflow\/rendercontext"]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Workflow/documentation/Workflow":{"title":"Workflow","role":"collection","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Workflow\/documentation\/Workflow","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/workflow"},"doc://Workflow/documentation/Workflow/RenderContext/makeSink(of:onEvent:)":{"title":"makeSink(of:onEvent:)","role":"symbol","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"code":"WorkflowType","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Workflow","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Workflow\/documentation\/Workflow\/RenderContext\/makeSink(of:onEvent:)","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/workflow\/rendercontext\/makesink(of:onevent:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"makeSink","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"of","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Workflow13RenderContextC8makeSink2of7onEvent